 for zero-ratio distributions.\n  - Handles zero, negative, and empty available space safely.\n  - Falls back to minimum sizes when provided.\n  - Evenly distributes space when ratios are all zero and no minimums exist.\n\n- **`rich/table.py`**\n  - Flexible columns now preserve a minimum width of one content character plus padding.\n  - Collapse and last-resort reduction logic respects flexible-column minimums.\n  - Prevents headers and cell values from disappearing into zero-width columns.\n  - Re-measured widths are clamped to the flexible minimum.\n  - Empty and constrained expanded tables no longer trigger ratio calculation errors.\n\n### Verification\n\nPassed:\n\n```text\npytest tests/test_ratio.py tests/test_tools.py tests/test_table.py -q\n32 passed\n```\n\nAlso manually verified the reported dashboard reproduction and empty expanded tables."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openai/gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":3,"output":394,"cacheRead":20645,"cacheWrite":329,"reasoning":192,"totalTokens":21371,"cost":{"input":6.000000000000001e-7,"output":0.0004728,"cacheRead":0.0004129,"cacheWrite":0.00008225,"total":0.00096855,"totalFromProvider":true}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1794168826103,"responseId":"gen-1794168826-yYa9xp3wpvnJlF9yOCU7","rawStopReason":"stop","durationMs":5143,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}],"willRetry":false}
